//     in a git repository is initialized in place. When the name is taken
//     or the directory is in a git repository, on_conflict "open" opens
//     that project instead and returns the conflict under "conflict";
//     without it the conflict is returned as the error.
//   - local: open the repository holding path. Worktrees and other clones
//     of a known repository join its project.
